  "content": "IronWorm is the latest indication of how developers and development environments have become prime targets for threat actors looking to compromise supply chains . Driving the interest is the fact that developers often hold privileged access to source code repositories, package registries, cloud environments, CI/CD pipelines, and signing keys. By compromising a single developer, threat actors can potentially introduce malicious code into trusted software projects and reach numerous downstream organizations and users.",
